# Workshop scheduled work — crontab template.
#
# Do NOT install this file by hand: the @WORKSHOP_ROOT@ token below is a
# placeholder. Run
#   bash scripts/install_cron.sh
# which substitutes this checkout's absolute path and splices the block into
# the user crontab between its markers, leaving any unrelated entries alone.
#
# WHY CRON AND NOT SYSTEMD TIMERS. These predate the systemd units and several
# encode wall-clock windows (the commute ticks) that read more clearly as cron
# expressions than as OnCalendar= lists. Converting them is a real change with
# real risk of a missed window, so it is a deliberate open choice, not an
# oversight. If you convert them, convert ALL of them and delete this file.
#
# ENVIRONMENT. cron gives these scripts almost nothing: no EnvironmentFile, no
# systemd Environment=, a bare PATH and no WORKSHOP_* vars. Every script here
# therefore sources scripts/lib/instance.sh itself to pick up this deployment's
# identity. A new scheduled script that skips that step will run with the wrong
# paths and fail quietly, which is the single most common way a cron entry here
# has broken.
#
# TIMES ARE SYSTEM-LOCAL (this deployment: US/Pacific, the operator's tz).

# ---- Autonomous work: OFF by operator decision 2026-08-10 ----
# Disabled HERE rather than by the emergency override at
# .runtime/autonomy-override.json, which was engaged 2026-07-18 for an
# 'in-flight coherence migration' that ended long ago and had become the
# only thing holding autonomy off. Off is now expressed where it is true:
# nothing autonomous is scheduled. Re-enable by uncommenting these two.
#
# THIS COMMENT STATE IS THE OPERATOR'S DECISION, NOT AN ACCIDENT OF EDITING.
# install_cron.sh installs these lines exactly as they appear here. Do not
# uncomment them to "restore" anything.
# */20 * * * * @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/cron_agent.sh
0 14 * * * @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/scripts/daily_todo_digest.sh

# ---- Commute (Phase 6) — times are in system tz (US/Pacific, operator's tz) ----
# Pre-commute briefs: 60min and 30min before AM target_depart_home (07:10)
10 6 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh pre-1h
40 6 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh pre-30m
# Pre-commute briefs: 60min and 30min before PM target_depart_work (18:00)
0 17 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh pre-1h
30 17 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh pre-30m
# During-commute: every 5 minutes through the AM active window (07:00-09:30)
*/5 7 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh during
*/5 8 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh during
0,5,10,15,20,25,30 9 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh during
# During-commute: every 5 minutes through the PM active window (18:00-20:00)
*/5 18 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh during
*/5 19 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh during
# Post-commute settle (cooldown reset reads happen here; mostly no-op)
30 9 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh post
0 20 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/tick.sh post
# Post-commute pattern-learning note (19:30 PT = 19:30 system time)
30 19 * * 1-5 @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/apps/commute/scripts/notes.sh

# ---- Autonomy reinforcement (rebuild 2026-05-22) ----
# Curriculum tick: refill the queue when [ ] count drops below threshold (hourly)
# Daily autonomy report: dropped into notify-masini.txt at 7am PT
0 7 * * * @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/scripts/autonomy_report.sh

# ---- Frontend watchdog (added 2026-06-06): restart Vite dev servers if they die ----
#
# Defers to systemd: when workshop-frontend.service exists it restarts the UNIT
# rather than spawning its own vite, so it can no longer hold :5173 outside the
# unit's cgroup and leave the unit crash-looping. The bare setsid relaunch is
# the fallback for a box with no unit.
*/2 * * * * @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/scripts/frontends_watchdog.sh

# ---- Task queue worker loop: ensure the resident runner is up (restart-on-death) ----
# Disabled with the rest of autonomous work (see the top of this file).
# */5 * * * * @WORKSHOP_ROOT@/scripts/queue_runner_watchdog.sh
